    "description": "<p>You can spend <strong>1 AP</strong> to shoot web at a target within 5 Spaces.</p><p>Make an <strong>Attack</strong> <strong>Check</strong> contested by the target’s <strong>Physical Save</strong>.</p><p><strong>Success:</strong> The target is Restrained by webbing and can spend <strong>1 AP</strong> on their turn to attempt to escape (Martial Check vs your Save DC).</p><p>The webbing can also be attacked and destroyed (<strong>AD 5, PD 10,</strong> <strong>2 HP</strong>; Immunity to Bludgeoning, Poison, and Psychic damage).</p>",
